  endingTitle: Death_HungerAndHeat
  titleDA: Sult og hede
  descriptionDA: "\xC5h nej! Det var for varmt, og pandaen fik ikke nok mad. Den
    blev for sulten og svag til at forts\xE6tte.\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk
    have, st\xF8tter du et avlsprogram, der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer!
    \nOg n\xE5r du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter, s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper
    dig med at v\xE6lge produkter, der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: Hunger And Heat
  descriptionEN: "Oh no! It was too hot, and the panda didn\u2019t get enough food.
    It got too hungry and weak to keep going. \n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support
    a breeding program that helps protect giant pandas! \nAnd when you buy bamboo
    products, look for the FSC label. It helps you choose products made with care
    for forests and wildlife.  "
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
